{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/09800f208076d0eaa4d6a87b12cac054.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>D.R.I.F.T.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>( Deep Range Independent Freight and Trade )</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A slow-paced space simulation focused on contracts, reputation, and systemic decision-making.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate within a living galaxy that reacts to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/ec9cb791377d665803dbee699db6775f.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contracts, Not Quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t follow a story.<br>You accept contracts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/b85bc8debd2f6ad4000705191bddc993.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation determines prices, access, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/c96ec11c7f88486c5471dcac04838019.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>The system reacts. It doesn\u2019t adapt to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/f143af3f2f016628db716aecf573fab4.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>D.R.I.F.T. is:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow and deliberate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System-driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contract-based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation-focused</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/b86053e71017190326d1e37b6de71b2e.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>D.R.I.F.T. is NOT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A power fantasy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/42d1fc20945959c6209f39dddcb2ab6c.avif?t=1773958343\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;The galaxy doesn\u2019t care if you succeed&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delivery Boy of the Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4036980/41dd73abc7a57e0927cd552918544b027dd46959.jpg"},{"name":"Too Late for the Bonus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4036980/a4a47382f54ea6e1519b1cf